SUMMARY:Deadline: Lendhauer: Urban Ecologies - Coexistence and Control (Len
 dhafen\, Klagenfurt 2027)
DESCRIPTION:The Klagenfurt association Lendhauer invites proposals for artw
 orks at the Lendhafen\, the city's harbour\, under the 2027 theme Urban Ec
 ologies: Coexistence and Control.\n\nOrganisation: Lendhauer (Klagenfurt\,
  Austria)\nLocation: Lendhafen harbour\, Klagenfurt\, Austria. Open to ind
 ividuals and collectives based in Austria or abroad.\nAward: Artist fee up
  to EUR 2\,500 gross\, production costs up to EUR 4\,000 gross (depending 
 on project scope)\, and travel expenses up to EUR 1\,000. No application f
 ee.\nDuration: Projects realised at the Lendhafen between June and the end
